# ── Per-client values (this repo's .env) ─────────────────────────────────────

# Web3Forms access key — https://web3forms.com (free, created with the
# CLIENT's email so submissions land in their inbox). The contact form is
# disabled gracefully when empty. Baked in at BUILD time — must be here
# locally, a Cloudflare-dashboard env var never reaches a direct upload.
PUBLIC_WEB3FORMS_KEY=""

# Cloudflare Pages project for `npm run deploy`. Written automatically by
# `npm run deploy:setup` (pins the project so a later siteUrl change can't
# silently retarget deploys); derived from data.seo.siteUrl when empty.
CLOUDFLARE_PAGES_PROJECT=""

# Optional — wrangler auth without the browser login (CI, second machine):
# CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN=""

# ── STUDIO-level values (prefer MACHINE env vars over this file!) ────────────
# One Google OAuth "Desktop app" client serves every client site
# (`npm run gsc:setup`, `npm run report`). Keep these as machine-level
# environment variables or in the password manager — NEVER commit them and
# avoid per-repo .env copies: a leaked client checkout must not expose
# Search Console access for every client. Scripts read process.env first,
# so machine-level values win over this file.
# GOOGLE_OAUTH_CLIENT_ID=""
# GOOGLE_OAUTH_CLIENT_SECRET=""
# GOOGLE_OAUTH_REFRESH_TOKEN=""
